ely. \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s55\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:1812\", \"start\": 445, \"end\": 576, \"text\": \"Additionally, she is remembered as a child actress from the films \\\"Field of Dreams\\\", \\\"Uncle Buck\\\", \\\" Now and Then\\\", and \\\" Volcano\\\".\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s56\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:5994\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 211, \"text\": \"Amy Madigan\\nAmy Marie Madigan (born September 11, 1950) is an American actress, producer, and singer. She was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress for the 1985 film \\\"Twice in a Lifetime\\\". \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s57\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:5994\", \"start\": 211, \"end\": 411, \"text\": \"Her other film credits include \\\"Love Child\\\" (1982), \\\"Places in the Heart\\\" (1984), \\\"Field of Dreams\\\" (1989), \\\"Uncle Buck\\\" (1989), \\\"The Dark Half\\\" (1993), \\\"Pollock\\\" (2000), and \\\"Gone Baby Gone\\\" (2007). \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s58\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:5994\", \"start\": 411, \"end\": 672, \"text\": \"Madigan won the Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actress on Television and was nominated for the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Miniseries or a Movie for her portrayal of Sarah Weddington in the 1989 television film \\\"Roe vs. Wade\\\".\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s59\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:4254\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 207, \"text\": \"Donnie Wahlberg\\nDonald Edmond Wahlberg Jr. (born August 17, 1969) is an American singer, songwriter, actor, record producer, and film producer. He is a founding member of the boy band New Kids on the Block. \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s60\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:4254\", \"start\": 207, \"end\": 481, \"text\": \"Outside of music, he has had roles in the \\\"Saw\\\" films, \\\"The Sixth Sense\\\", \\\"Dreamcatcher\\\", and \\\"Righteous Kill\\\", also appearing in the World War II miniseries \\\"Band of Brothers\\\" as First Lieutenant Carwood Lipton. From 2002 to 2003, he starred in the crime drama \\\"Boomtown\\\". \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s61\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:4254\", \"start\": 481, \"end\": 829, \"text\": \"He has been starring in the drama series \\\"Blue Bloods\\\" as Danny Reagan with Tom Selleck (his TV father) and Bridget Moynahan (his TV sister) since 2010, and since 2014 is an executive producer of the TNT reality television show \\\"Boston's Finest\\\". He was nominated for \\\"Choice Scream\\\" at the 2008 Teen Choice Awards for his work in the \\\"Saw\\\" films. \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s62\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:4254\", \"start\": 829, \"end\": 993, \"text\": \"He has also produced and starred in \\\"Rock this Boat\\\", \\\"Donnie Loves Jenny\\\" and \\\"Return of the Mac\\\" on Pop TV. He also produces and stars in \\\"Wahlburgers\\\" on A&E TV.\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s63\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:3838\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 306, \"text\": \"Me and You and Everyone We Know\\nMe and You and Everyone We Know is a 2005 American romantic comedy-drama film written and directed by Miranda July (her directorial debut) and stars July, John Hawkes, Miles Thompson, Brandon Ratcliff, Natasha Slayton, Najarra Townsend, Carlie Westerman, and JoNell Kennedy.\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s64\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:338\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 282, \"text\": \"Lea Thompson\\nLea Katherine Thompson (born May 31, 1961) is an American actress, television director, and television producer. She is known for her role as Lorraine Baines in the \\\"Back to the Future\\\" trilogy and as the title character in the 1990s NBC sitcom \\\"Caroline in the City\\\". \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s65\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:338\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 585, \"text\": \"Other films for which she is known include \\\"All the Right Moves\\\" (1983), \\\"Red Dawn\\\" (1984), \\\"Howard the Duck\\\" (1986) \\\"Some Kind of Wonderful\\\" (1987), and \\\"The Beverly Hillbillies\\\" (1993). From 2011-2017, she co-starred as Kathryn Kennish in the Freeform (formerly ABC Family) series \\\"Switched at Birth\\\".\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s66\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:6000\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 259, \"text\": \"Jeff Bridges\\nJeffrey Leon Bridges (born December 4, 1949) is an American actor, singer and producer. He comes from a prominent acting family and appeared on the television series \\\"Sea Hunt\\\" (1958–60), with his father, Lloyd Bridges and brother, Beau Bridges. \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s67\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:6000\", \"start\": 259, \"end\": 581, \"text\": \"He won the Academy Award for Best Actor for his role as Otis \\\"Bad\\\" Blake in the 2009 film \\\"Crazy Heart\\\", and earned Academy Award nominations for his roles in \\\"The Last Picture Show\\\" (1971), \\\"Thunderbolt and Lightfoot\\\" (1974), \\\"Starman\\\" (1984), \\\"The Contender\\\" (2000), \\\"True Grit\\\" (2010), and \\\"Hell or High Water\\\" (2016). \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s68\", \"doc_id\": \"hotpotqa:6000\", \"start\": 581, \"end\": 822, \"text\": \"His other films include \\\"Tron\\\" (1982), \\\"Jagged Edge\\\" (1985), \\\"The Fabulous Baker Boys\\\" (1989), \\\"The Fisher King\\\" (1991), \\\"Fearless\\\" (1993), \\\"The Big Lebowski\\\" (1998), \\\"Seabiscuit\\\" (2003), \\\"Iron 